Alfredo runs as a hosted container on running.sh (project "liner-bot",
service svc_3euskcktn5cb64lhb3wx, https://alfredo-bot-liner-bot-pwdq.running.sh/health).

This marker retires every local runner path on this host — run_forever.sh,
